{"id":"64b8b4f0b203604e","bookSlug":"zhou-machine-learning","relPath":"course-resources.md","title":"课程资源","sections":["正文"],"excerpt":"课件、tinyml 源码和分 P 视频按教材章节对应整理。正文与课程安排请直接从课程首页进入。","order":2,"previousId":"dc419d2921af03c8","nextId":"7a24220bb8809970","html":"<div class=\"study-hero study-hero--ml\">\n<p><span class=\"study-hero__eyebrow\">TEXTBOOK · SLIDES · NUMPY CODE · VIDEO</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"_1\">课程资源</h1>\n<p>课件、<code>tiny_ml</code> 源码和分 P 视频按教材章节对应整理。正文与课程安排请直接从课程首页进入。</p>\n<p><a class=\"md-button md-button--primary\" href=\"#/doc/7a24220bb8809970\">打开 tiny_ml 算法实验室</a>\n<a class=\"md-button\" href=\"#/doc/dc419d2921af03c8\">返回图书首页</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"resource-legend\">\n  <span><b class=\"resource-dot resource-dot--article\"></b>正文</span>\n  <span><b class=\"resource-dot resource-dot--slides\"></b>课件 PDF</span>\n  <span><b class=\"resource-dot resource-dot--code\"></b>NumPy 源码</span>\n  <span><b class=\"resource-dot resource-dot--video\"></b>视频</span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"admonition info\">\n<p class=\"admonition-title\">资源使用原则</p>\n<p>正文负责定义和完整叙述，课件负责抓主线，代码负责把公式落实成计算步骤，视频用于补充推导与直觉。空白项表示目前没有可靠资源，页面不会用无关链接凑数。</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"course-list\">\n  <div class=\"course-row course-row--head\">\n    <span>主题</span><span>正文</span><span>课件</span><span>代码</span><span>视频</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"course-row\">\n    <div class=\"course-topic\"><small>第 1 课 · 第 1 章</small><strong>绪论与学习方法</strong><p>基本概念、假设空间与机器学习的学习路径。</p></div>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--article\" href=\"../chapters/01-introduction/\" aria-label=\"阅读第1章正文\">正文</a>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--slides\" href=\"../courseware/lesson-01-introduction.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">课件</a>\n    <span class=\"course-action course-action--empty\">—</span>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--video\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gG411f7zX/?p=3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">视频</a>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"course-row\">\n    <div class=\"course-topic\"><small>第 2 课 · 第 2 章</small><strong>模型评估与选择</strong><p>泛化、过拟合、数据划分、性能度量与比较检验。</p></div>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--article\" href=\"../chapters/02-model-evaluation-and-selection/\">正文</a>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--slides\" href=\"../courseware/lesson-02-model-evaluation.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">课件</a>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--code\" href=\"../tinyml-lab/#comparison\">对照</a>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--video\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gG411f7zX/?p=9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">视频</a>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"course-row\">\n    <div class=\"course-topic\"><small>第 3 课 · 第 3 章</small><strong>线性模型</strong><p>线性回归、逻辑回归、LDA 与类别不平衡。</p></div>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--article\" href=\"../chapters/03-linear-models/\">正文</a>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--slides\" href=\"../courseware/lesson-03-linear-models.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">课件</a>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--code\" href=\"../tinyml-lab/#linear-models\">代码</a>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--video\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gG411f7zX/?p=16\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">视频</a>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"course-row\">\n    <div class=\"course-topic\"><small>第 4 课 · 第 4 章</small><strong>决策树</strong><p>划分选择、剪枝、连续值与缺失值处理。</p></div>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--article\" href=\"../chapters/04-decision-trees/\">正文</a>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--slides\" href=\"../courseware/lesson-04-decision-trees.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">课件</a>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--code\" href=\"../tinyml-lab/#trees\">代码</a>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--video\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gG411f7zX/?p=26\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">视频</a>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"course-row\">\n    <div class=\"course-topic\"><small>第 6 课 · 第 5 章</small><strong>神经网络</strong><p>神经元模型、感知机、误差逆传播与全局最小。</p></div>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--article\" href=\"../chapters/05-neural-networks/\">正文</a>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--slides\" href=\"../courseware/lesson-06-neural-networks.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">课件</a>\n    <span class=\"course-action course-action--empty\">—</span>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--video\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gG411f7zX/?p=37\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">视频</a>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"course-row\">\n    <div class=\"course-topic\"><small>第 5 课 · 第 6 章</small><strong>支持向量机</strong><p>最大间隔、对偶问题、核函数与软间隔。</p></div>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--article\" href=\"../chapters/06-support-vector-machines/\">正文</a>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--slides\" href=\"../courseware/lesson-05-support-vector-machines.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">课件</a>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--code\" href=\"../tinyml-lab/#svm\">代码</a>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--video\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gG411f7zX/?p=31\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">视频</a>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"course-row\">\n    <div class=\"course-topic\"><small>第 7 课 · 第 7 章</small><strong>贝叶斯分类器</strong><p>贝叶斯决策论、极大似然与朴素贝叶斯。</p></div>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--article\" href=\"../chapters/07-bayesian-classifiers/\">正文</a>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--slides\" href=\"../courseware/lesson-07-bayesian-classifiers.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">课件</a>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--code\" href=\"../tinyml-lab/#bayes\">代码</a>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--video\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gG411f7zX/?p=42\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">视频</a>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"course-row\">\n    <div class=\"course-topic\"><small>第 8 课 · 第 8 章</small><strong>集成学习</strong><p>Boosting、Bagging、随机森林与多样性。</p></div>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--article\" href=\"../chapters/08-ensemble-learning/\">正文</a>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--slides\" href=\"../courseware/lesson-08-ensemble-learning.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">课件</a>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--code\" href=\"../tinyml-lab/#ensemble\">代码</a>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--video\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gG411f7zX/?p=48\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">视频</a>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"course-row\">\n    <div class=\"course-topic\"><small>第 9 章</small><strong>聚类</strong><p>距离度量、原型聚类、密度聚类与层次聚类。</p></div>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--article\" href=\"../chapters/09-clustering/\">正文</a>\n    <span class=\"course-action course-action--empty\">—</span>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--code\" href=\"../tinyml-lab/#clustering\">代码</a>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--video\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gG411f7zX/?p=53\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">视频</a>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"course-row\">\n    <div class=\"course-topic\"><small>第 10 章</small><strong>降维与度量学习</strong><p>PCA、MDS、流形学习与度量学习。</p></div>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--article\" href=\"../chapters/10-dimensionality-reduction-and-metric-learning/\">正文</a>\n    <span class=\"course-action course-action--empty\">—</span>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--code\" href=\"../tinyml-lab/#dimensionality\">代码</a>\n    <span class=\"course-action course-action--empty\">—</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"course-row\">\n    <div class=\"course-topic\"><small>第 11 章</small><strong>特征选择与稀疏学习</strong><p>子集搜索、过滤式选择与 Relief。</p></div>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--article\" href=\"../chapters/11-feature-selection-and-sparse-learning/\">正文</a>\n    <span class=\"course-action course-action--empty\">—</span>\n    <a class=\"course-action course-action--code\" href=\"../tinyml-lab/#feature-selection\">代码</a>\n    <span class=\"course-action course-action--empty\">—</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<details class=\"advanced-chapters\">\n<summary>展开第 12–16 章进阶正文</summary>\n<div class=\"advanced-chapter-links\">\n  <a href=\"../chapters/12-computational-learning-theory/\"><b>第 12 章</b><span>计算学习理论</span></a>\n  <a href=\"../chapters/13-semi-supervised-learning/\"><b>第 13 章</b><span>半监督学习</span></a>\n  <a href=\"../chapters/14-probabilistic-graphical-models/\"><b>第 14 章</b><span>概率图模型</span></a>\n  <a href=\"../chapters/15-rule-learning/\"><b>第 15 章</b><span>规则学习</span></a>\n  <a href=\"../chapters/16-reinforcement-learning/\"><b>第 16 章</b><span>强化学习</span></a>\n</div>\n</details>\n\n<h2 id=\"_2\">推荐使用顺序</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>用课件快速建立本章结构，记下三个关键词。</li>\n<li>阅读正文，补齐定义、公式和边界条件。</li>\n<li>打开 <code>tiny_ml</code> 对应实现，沿着数据形状、目标函数、参数更新和停止条件阅读。</li>\n<li>最后看视频中仍不清楚的分 P，并用自己的话写一段解释。</li>\n</ol>","headings":[{"level":2,"id":"_2","text":"推荐使用顺序"}]}